{
  "status": "PASS",
  "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
  "rate": "+5%",
  "seconds": 35.52,
  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.06,
      "end": 0.339124,
      "text": "Why does a"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.35129200000000005,
      "end": 1.576999,
      "text": "car window explode"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.649833,
      "end": 2.766333,
      "text": "into tiny cubes?"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.026365777777779,
      "end": 4.021489777777779,
      "text": "It's tempered glass:"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.421990777777778,
      "end": 5.210865777777779,
      "text": "heated red hot,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.514240777777778,
      "end": 6.315198777777779,
      "text": "then blasted with"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.327323777777779,
      "end": 6.946281777777779,
      "text": "cold air."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.206314555555557,
      "end": 7.618980555555558,
      "text": "The surface"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.631106555555557,
      "end": 8.529147555555557,
      "text": "hardens first."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.929647555555558,
      "end": 9.645647555555557,
      "text": "Then the inside"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.657772555555557,
      "end": 11.296105555555556,
      "text": "cools, shrinks, and"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.308272555555558,
      "end": 11.963605555555556,
      "text": "squeezes the"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.975731555555559,
      "end": 12.764563555555558,
      "text": "surface tight."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.024596333333337,
      "end": 13.801346333333337,
      "text": "That squeeze makes"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.813429333333335,
      "end": 14.432388333333336,
      "text": "it about four"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.444513333333337,
      "end": 15.439679333333336,
      "text": "times stronger than"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.451804333333335,
      "end": 16.313471333333336,
      "text": "normal glass."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.573504111111113,
      "end": 17.168212111111114,
      "text": "But the energy"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.180296111111115,
      "end": 18.369629111111113,
      "text": "stays locked inside."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.782254111111115,
      "end": 19.219170111111115,
      "text": "Break through the"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.231296111111114,
      "end": 20.250712111111113,
      "text": "surface, and it"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.262837111111114,
      "end": 20.821087111111115,
      "text": "all lets go"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.833212111111113,
      "end": 21.415753111111115,
      "text": "at once."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.675785888888896,
      "end": 22.683076888888895,
      "text": "Cracks race across"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.695202888888893,
      "end": 23.423368888888895,
      "text": "the pane at"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.435493888888896,
      "end": 24.187909888888896,
      "text": "nearly a mile"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.200077888888895,
      "end": 24.758327888888896,
      "text": "per second,"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.018360666666673,
      "end": 25.94069366666667,
      "text": "leaving blunt little"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.952818666666673,
      "end": 26.850901666666672,
      "text": "cubes instead of"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.86302766666667,
      "end": 27.89456866666667,
      "text": "knife-like shards."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.15460144444445,
      "end": 29.33180944444445,
      "text": "Windshields\\Nare different:"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.70801844444445,
      "end": 30.64247644444445,
      "text": "glued to plastic,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.84880944444445,
      "end": 31.64972644444445,
      "text": "they crack but"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.66189344444445,
      "end": 32.426434444444446,
      "text": "hold together."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.686467222222234,
      "end": 33.57238422222223,
      "text": "That's why emergency"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.584550222222234,
      "end": 34.36125822222223,
      "text": "hammers are made"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.373384222222235,
      "end": 35.31996722222223,
      "text": "for side windows."
    }
  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.9663657777777788,
      "narration_en": "Why does a car window explode into tiny cubes?",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ca30fcf09cf4853e0da9e87289ae459e8572387e542883ae7a89e1f681d69a17"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.9663657777777788,
      "end": 7.146314555555557,
      "narration_en": "It's tempered glass: heated red hot, then blasted with cold air.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "d81c73a1901ddf0a494d416757a634aeffcb9ef4e119b2575aca12d493362407"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.146314555555557,
      "end": 12.964596333333336,
      "narration_en": "The surface hardens first. Then the inside cools, shrinks, and squeezes the surface tight.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "3ee130b5a9bb1fb0ff441ec492f3c2ff8370e05343f750dae36d7da0f112a356"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.964596333333336,
      "end": 16.513504111111114,
      "narration_en": "That squeeze makes it about four times stronger than normal glass.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5e87ec658a85ecb365aa97e45f9030b41b183ff2e87e35bd65ebefbe1d28ae79"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.513504111111114,
      "end": 21.615785888888894,
      "narration_en": "But the energy stays locked inside. Break through the surface, and it all lets go at once.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "e73443022f8223429372c6b41a362208c551a55ad898cc0be24e0fd5f3ee32fe"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.615785888888894,
      "end": 24.95836066666667,
      "narration_en": "Cracks race across the pane at nearly a mile per second,",
      "source_audio_sha256": "c79d78817241d6df08747533acd31ab1b2f7b635c1d273410c9cf341e63c2f1b"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.95836066666667,
      "end": 28.09460144444445,
      "narration_en": "leaving blunt little cubes instead of knife-like shards.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "c7ef9a9bb33f7ccd844d0e51e406530269ad30a349617971070415cabfa2d0a2"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.09460144444445,
      "end": 32.62646722222223,
      "narration_en": "Windshields are different: glued to plastic, they crack but hold together.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "64bd2bb9f3e471617e97e3f0365ecbbb38f2fe509315410de45a409aa60fbec8"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.62646722222223,
      "end": 35.52,
      "narration_en": "That's why emergency hammers are made for side windows.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "6765b97fc67cb44ddd9f7a669e4a8407352c905ed173f60f636a625da4b87615"
    }
  ],
